  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. Set aside.\n• Cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac2631b3b0e57120a62f2b-05d74ff7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with BBQ spice blend, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac2631b3b0e57120a62f2b-ddea39d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 mins remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm slices.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.\n• Add the honey and water and cook, tossing, until coated, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac2631b3b0e57120a62f2b-012784ce.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add baby spinach and a drizzle of vinegar to tray with roast veggies. Toss to coat.\n• Divide rainbow roast veggies between bowls. Top with haloumi and a drizzle of the mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac2631b3b0e57120a62f2b-1165d116.jpeg"
    }
  ]
